  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>→</mo></math>represents a red ball is drawn,</p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Probability of getting red ball for the first time at <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> trial <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
